    <Name>Anarchy Radio FM</Name>
    <Description>Anarchy Radio FM — the in-game bridge for the Anarchy Radio FM external music engine. Reports game state so a companion desktop app can play your own local music (or Spotify) per screen. Requires the Music Modding System (MMS).</Description>
